DogeOS changes: provider-neutral Secret references, pinned image, full server
state persistence, Recreate/single-controller lifecycle, external PostgreSQL,
optional ingress, schema validation and offline tests. No Nebius backend or
Marketplace configuration is installed. This chart is maintained by DogeOS,
not by Nebius or the dstack project.
